3. Using the plugin

Horizon Pad is free to download, install and use. The music you make with it is yours,
whether you share it with the whole world or keep it on a hard drive nobody will ever find.
The factory presets (presets/) are free to use, share and change; presets you save are
yours. The plugin is provided as is, without warranty of any kind.

Third-party components carry their own licences (THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
